              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Sam 9:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïng Yonatan wero Saulö werïnyi nyo kikïkuro Mepiposyet. Kitïng könyis mut otini kituna ngala megha Saulö nko Yonatan kanasyanta Yesrel. Kïsït chepö monïng akurïpteghö, otini kimi kurïpöy, kuchunta monïngay kusïnkwala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwö Rekap nko Paana werpö Rimon, chi pö Peerot, kutang wölo mi Isposyet, kwit wölini keghyö asis, kïnyorï nyinte mi kumungöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnyorï ripinto kukat nyo kitïghöy nkanun kinam rïwöntö, kïlï Rekap kö nko werïngwa Paana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kïnyorï ripinto kukat nyo kitïghöy nkanun kinam rïwöntö, kïlï Rekap kö nko werïngwa Paana:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kirïp kikirut walaka cho pö köny. Ompö Eprania kï, kipa kïlïtöy kö le pich cho kimököy kwipöy nkanun. Kïtor nyinte mu, atolapay kupertoy.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnyorï Isposyet rïwöy pöröyenyi, kïpar akïnïk kat. Kïcheng mötït akïpa kïyech kuwer mpöghoghyo Arapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwipchï mötay Daudi nyo kimi Epron akïlenchï, “Anyï möt pö Isposyet wero Saulö punyontengu nyay kiyöröy söpontöngu, kökoninyi asete ECHOTYON pöroyïn we pöytoghin tökisyenö ompö Saulö nko monechi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Daudi Rekap nko Paana werpö Rimon, chi pö Peerot, “Owolwolan ompö kaynata ECHOTYON nyo kïsörunenanïn kömpölelut löwïr, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.1+2SA.1.2+2SA.1.3+2SA.1.4+2SA.1.5+2SA.1.6+2SA.1.7+2SA.1.8+2SA.1.9+2SA.1.10+2SA.1.11+2SA.1.12+2SA.1.13+2SA.1.14+2SA.1.15+2SA.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Sam 1:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lö, ‘Odenan chi anka tïkwïl wölo kyadan chi nyo kinonöy lö omwowanïn ngal cho karamach lö, kikïma Saulö. Kyanaman nyinte aparan ompö Siklak, kïlïkwï nyoni ropöwontenyi ompö ngalechi choni karamach.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghöyitu tya ye nyu ompö pich cho ghach cho kapar chi nyo mötïngnye lelut ato mi rïwön, omeghokwa ye nyu le nyinte.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmwochï Daudi pikachi kïpar chane akïtör morikwa nko kelyekwa akuwusyï kamasu ngarpïlu Epron, wölo kïcheng möt pö Isposyet akïtïpchï pïrïmpo Apner ompö Epron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kalïkwï Daudi pöytoghinto pipö Israel nko Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
